WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.492
- [Kelly] Oh, my gosh.

00:00:01.492 --> 00:00:02.325
Have y'all met before?

00:00:02.325 --> 00:00:03.316
- Yes!
- We have.

00:00:03.316 --> 00:00:04.149
- We have.

00:00:04.149 --> 00:00:05.627
- It's been a while.
- Love you.

00:00:05.627 --> 00:00:06.460
- Thank you.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:08.080
- You're amazing too, oh my goodness.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.590
- Was your mom a teacher, did I hear?

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:10.507
- Yes, she was, she was a teacher.

00:00:10.507 --> 00:00:12.080
- [Kelly] Did she ever teach you?

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.700
- Yeah, all the time, yeah.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.750
My dad was a psychologist,
my mom a teacher.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.800
So that was weird when I got a spanking.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.150
'Cause I would get a spanking by my mom

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:21.917
and then my dad would
go, "How did you feel

00:00:21.917 --> 00:00:23.029
"about that spanking?

00:00:23.029 --> 00:00:23.862
(group laughs)

00:00:23.862 --> 00:00:24.932
"How was it?"

00:00:24.932 --> 00:00:25.765
(group laughs)

00:00:25.765 --> 00:00:26.598
- Oh my God.

00:00:26.598 --> 00:00:29.190
I would love when my
parents would be like,

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:30.840
it'd be like this hurts
me more and it hurts you.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.088
I'm like, well turn around!

00:00:32.088 --> 00:00:34.190
Lets see.
- Turn around.

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:37.080
- Let's just, I mean,
might as well try it out.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.659
So wait, your new book, this
is called 'Blessed Mode.'

00:00:39.659 --> 00:00:40.492
- [Kel] Yes, exciting!

00:00:40.492 --> 00:00:41.890
- [Kelly] So what made
you want to do this?

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:43.500
- What made me wanna do it?

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.090
This is really a book to let everyone know

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:48.120
that in every emotional wall,

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:50.450
there is a divine breakthrough, right?

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.283
- [Kelly] Oh interesting.

00:00:51.283 --> 00:00:53.490
- And a lot of people are
going through a lot of things

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:54.400
in their lives,

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.480
that we don't know about.

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:56.490
- Especially the last two years.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:57.323
- Yeah.

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.250
And I want this book to be a positive way

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:00.840
where they can get up in the morning

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.010
and connect with God

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:03.790
and let them know that they are blessed.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.490
They were blessed when they were born.

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:06.323
You know?

00:01:06.323 --> 00:01:07.156
And that's what it's all about, yeah.

00:01:07.156 --> 00:01:07.989
- [Kelly] Blessed you're still here.

00:01:07.989 --> 00:01:09.085
- Yeah.

00:01:09.085 --> 00:01:09.918
Blessed that you're still here.

00:01:09.918 --> 00:01:10.867
Stay blessed, you are loved.

00:01:10.867 --> 00:01:11.734
(audience claps)

00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:12.567
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:01:12.567 --> 00:01:14.083
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:14.083 --> 00:01:14.918
(Angela claps)
(audience claps)

00:01:14.918 --> 00:01:15.751
- Did you ever...

00:01:15.751 --> 00:01:16.840
But it's a 90 day thing, right?

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:17.782
- Yeah.

00:01:17.782 --> 00:01:18.615
- So it's like, that's cool.

00:01:18.615 --> 00:01:19.448
So it's like every day you kind
of have something in there?

00:01:19.448 --> 00:01:21.190
- Well, it's a devotional.

00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:22.047
- I love that.

00:01:22.047 --> 00:01:23.950
- And a lot of my ups
and downs in my life,

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.650
God was always there.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:26.483
For me.

00:01:26.483 --> 00:01:28.900
And I wanted to show people what I do,

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:31.990
so that I can get into a positive mindset.

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.880
And it works on your mental health,

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:35.960
your spiritual health
and your physical health.

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:38.930
Yeah, so I start you
off with a Bible verse,

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:40.360
short story about my life.

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:41.830
And then I take you through a prayer

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.000
and then my favorite part is called,

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.710
'Go Get Them Blessings'.

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:46.660
Where you apply it to your life.

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:48.280
So I might have you forgive somebody.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:49.810
Or I might have you do a burpee.

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:51.261
You know what I mean?

00:01:51.261 --> 00:01:53.011
- Oh a burpee.
(Kel shouts)

00:01:53.011 --> 00:01:54.033
- It's physical health.

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:55.690
- I'll forgive people, I
don't wanna do a burpee.

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:56.652
That's (indistinct).

00:01:56.652 --> 00:01:57.650
(Kel laughs)

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:58.483
Awesome.
- Yeah.

00:01:58.483 --> 00:02:00.090
- So wait, so you talk about your struggle

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:00.923
with addiction right?

00:02:00.923 --> 00:02:01.756
In this?
- Yeah.

00:02:01.756 --> 00:02:02.589
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:03.500
That's awesome that you're
opening up about that

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:05.010
because that's really hard.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:07.590
I have a few friends actually.

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:09.140
Do you feel like faith is really what

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:10.110
pulled you through?

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:11.060
- Definitely.

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.980
It's like depression is
just like frustration,

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:16.030
that we just keep inside, you know?

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:17.470
And no one can understand.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.200
No one can understand
what I'm going through.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.170
And you don't want to talk about it.

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:21.003
And I did that a lot.

00:02:21.003 --> 00:02:23.900
And then I went to substance
abuse and things of nature

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:25.490
to try to cover it up.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:28.180
But then when I realized like, no, no, no,

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.960
I don't wanna cover this up anymore.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.300
I want to actually forgive myself-

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:33.262
- [Kelly] Shine a light on it.

00:02:33.262 --> 00:02:34.450
- Forgive others and shine a light on it.

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:35.283
Yeah.

00:02:35.283 --> 00:02:36.200
And actually talk about it.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.910
And when I decided to do that
and connect more with God,

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:39.743
you know what I mean?

00:02:39.743 --> 00:02:41.450
And connect on that level.

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:43.030
Everything started to
change around for me.

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.170
It took a journey, but
you know, in the Bible

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:46.550
it says renew your mind daily.

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:48.810
And so that's very important
that we renew our mind

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:49.643
all the time.

00:02:49.643 --> 00:02:50.580
'Cause this mind is like a disc.

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.250
It keeps everything, you know what I mean?

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.840
And you get reminded of like mistakes

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:54.673
in the past,

00:02:54.673 --> 00:02:55.506
things that people-

00:02:55.506 --> 00:02:56.339
- [Kelly] All the little voices.

00:02:56.339 --> 00:02:57.231
- Yeah.

00:02:57.231 --> 00:02:58.760
But that's why it's so important to get up

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.520
and just know like, no, no, no.

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:01.639
I was made for a purpose.

00:03:01.639 --> 00:03:02.630
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:03.490
- I have a purpose today, you know?

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:04.323
- Yeah.

00:03:04.323 --> 00:03:06.900
I unfortunately have had like
a few people die very young,

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:07.870
in my life, around me.

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:09.700
And it's one of those things
where I wake up every day

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:11.760
and I'm just like thankful to wake up.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.110
I'm like not everybody
gets that opportunity.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:15.370
Like even if you're having like hard time,

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:17.270
'cause I've also suffered from depression.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:19.000
And I can go zero dark 30.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.980
And so it's one of those
things where I think

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:22.783
that faith really helped me as well.

00:03:22.783 --> 00:03:24.280
Does faith help you at all?

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.130
- Oh, absolutely.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.790
Yeah, I grew up in the
family of faith and I mean,

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.880
that's my family that's, you know,

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:34.070
thankful to my mother
and I'm like you say,

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:34.903
this career,

00:03:34.903 --> 00:03:37.670
I came from just very, very humble

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:38.920
and to have a dream,

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.690
but to also know there's
something greater than you;

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.650
'cause you have those
moments and those days,

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:47.930
and those things that come against you.

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:49.700
You gotta know that you
can make it through.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.600
You know it's so, like you
say renew your mind daily.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:54.960
The word says you're
fearfully wonderfully made.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.700
It also says think on these things.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:58.619
You don't think of what's
good, what's positive.

00:03:58.619 --> 00:03:59.980
That's full of joy.

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.440
Think on those things.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.940
Because the battlefield is the mind.

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:05.207
- [Kelly] Absolutely.

00:04:05.207 --> 00:04:06.040
- [Kel] That's right.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:06.873
Amen.

00:04:06.873 --> 00:04:08.620
- And it's making sure
you're surrounding yourself

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:11.060
with people that have that kind
of positive energy as well.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.213
And it's so funny.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:14.140
Whatever you believe in;

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.860
there's a lot of beliefs out there.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:17.290
But it's one of those things where

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:18.280
I find it so hard to believe.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:19.600
I'm like, I can't imagine.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:22.290
I think what would've killed me,

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.220
would've been not believing that anything,

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:25.860
like any other bigger purpose for us.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:26.693
You know what I'm saying?

00:04:26.693 --> 00:04:27.730
There's nothing...

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.670
I have to feel like we're
all a part of something,

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.060
whatever your spiritual belief is,

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:32.690
that we're all all a part of something

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:33.560
that's bigger than us.

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:34.530
Like I don't know.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:37.380
I just feel like it's
a very egocentric thing

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:38.370
to not think that.

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:39.410
But-

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:40.243
- So true.

00:04:40.243 --> 00:04:41.410
- But that could be humanity
run amuck right there.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:45.470
But you are a blessed man and
this is a really, really cool-

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:46.372
- Appreciate it.

00:04:46.372 --> 00:04:47.205
- [Kelly] Thing to do, not just for you,

00:04:47.205 --> 00:04:48.038
but for other people

00:04:48.038 --> 00:04:48.963
- For other people,
that's what it's about.

00:04:48.963 --> 00:04:50.296
- [Kelly] That's really, really cool.

